  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味と　塩味のある　調味料。コクがあり　パンの食感も　よくなる。モーモーミルク１００％は　高級品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛과 짠맛이 나는 조미료. 진한 맛이 나며, 빵의 식감도 좋아진다. 튼튼밀크 100%인 것은 고급으로 친다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有甜味和鹹味的調味料。味道濃郁，還能提升麵包的口感。由１００％哞哞鮮奶製成的屬於高級品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût sucré et salé. Sa saveur de caractère se déguste encore mieux sur une tranche de pain. Le beurre de qualité est 100 % Lait Meumeu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses süßlich-salzige Würzmittel veredelt durch seine Cremigkeit die Konsistenz jedes Brotes. Markenbutter besteht zu 100 % aus reiner Kuhmuh-Milch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este ingrediente salado tiene un toque dulce y aporta tanto sabor como textura al pan. La mejor es la elaborada solamente con Leche Mu-mu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento dolce e salato. Ha un gusto intenso e migliora anche la consistenza del pane. Le varietà più pregiate sono prodotte al 100% con Latte Mumu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment that unites salty and sweet and also packs a richness that makes bread a delight to eat. The finest butter products are made of 100 percent Moomoo Milk.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味と　塩味のある　調味料。コクがあり　パンの食感も　よくなる。モーモーミルク１００％は　高級品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
